.TH BIO 1.SH NAMEbio \- biorhythm chart.SH SYNOPSIS\fBrunb bio\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA biorhythm chart in BASIC09.  It asks a Date, then a Birthday, both asday.month.year with a four-digit year\fR(\fB21.09.2026\fR);\fRRETURN at the Date prompt takes the system date.  Then\fBg\fRdraws a graph, or\fBv\fRprints the values, for the number of days you ask: the physical,emotional and mental cycles, each a sine wave of its own period countedfrom the day you were born..SH NOTES\fBbio\fRis BASIC09 I-code.  Run it with Microware's\fBrunb\fRloaded, by the bare module name:\fBload runb\fR,\fRthen\fBbio\fR.\fRA pathname given to\fBrunb\fRraises BASIC09 error 43..SH SEE ALSOblackjack